{
  "slug": "acumatica-plugin",
  "name": "Acumatica Plugin",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "What's included\nFinance — invoices, bills, payments, journal entries, cash accounts\nInventory & Purchasing — stock items, purchase orders, receipts, vendors\nCRM — customers, leads, opportunities, contacts\nReports — aged receivables, aged payables, trial balance, customer statements, ad-hoc analysis",
  "longDescription": "Ships **5 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (5): `acumatica-crm` (This skill should be used when the user asks about customers, leads, opportunities, or contacts), `acumatica-finance` (This skill should be used when the user asks about invoices, bills, payments, journal entries, cash accounts, AR,…), `acumatica-inventory` (This skill should be used when the user asks about purchase orders, POs, stock items, inventory, vendors, receipts,…), `acumatica-reports` (This skill should be used when the user asks for a report, analysis, or summary of Acumatica data), `acumatica-setup` (This skill should be used when the user says \"connect to Acumatica\", \"set up Acumatica\", \"configure Acumatica\", or…)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `acumatica`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install acumatica-plugin@claude-community` from `allanwei/claude-acu-try`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
